# ParityCorpusBaseline.json is `14` §13's committed parity corpus, re-asserted on Linux x64 and
# Android ARM64 by the cross-platform determinism job. (The iOS ARM64 leg is authored and gated off
# with iOS itself, `16` D34.) Its line endings are pinned to LF so the file is byte-identical on both
# of them, and so a one-chunk change never diffs as a whole-file rewrite because someone's
# core.autocrlf disagreed. Same rule as the Core.Tests vector directories and game-data/.
*.json text eol=lf
